### ==========================================
### 1. MODULUL FLEET (Gestiunea Resurselor)
### ==========================================

### 1.1. Adaugă un Vehicul (Camion)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fleet/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registration_number": "IF-22-DEMO",
  "make": "Volvo",
  "model": "FH16",
  "vehicle_type": "BOX_TRUCK",
  "year_of_manufacture": 2023,
  "max_weight_kg": 24000,
  "max_volume_m3": 90,
  "fuel_type": "Diesel",
  "current_mileage": 15000,
  "insurance_policy_number": "INS-2024-001",
  "insurance_expiry_date": "2025-12-31",
  "registration_expiry_date": "2025-12-31"
}

### 1.2. Adaugă un Șofer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fleet/drivers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ion Popescu",
  "license_number": "L-12345678",
  "license_type": "CE",
  "license_issue_date": "2020-01-01",
  "license_expiry_date": "2030-01-01",
  "phone_number": "0722123456",
  "email": "ion.popescu@transport.ro",
  "address": "Str. Soferilor nr. 1, Bucuresti",
  "emergency_contact_name": "Maria Popescu",
  "emergency_contact_phone": "0733654321",
  "employment_date": "2022-05-01"
}

### 1.3. Verifică Vehiculele Disponibile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fleet/vehicles/available

### ==========================================
### 2. MODULUL CUSTOMER (Clienți & Contracte)
### ==========================================

### 2.1. Creează un Client Nou
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "Mega Retailer SRL",
  "tax_id_number": "RO123456789",
  "registration_number": "J40/123/2020",
  "primary_contact_name": "Andrei Manager",
  "primary_contact_phone": "0744999888",
  "primary_contact_email": "contact@megaretailer.ro",
  "billing_address": {
    "street": "Bd. Unirii nr. 10",
    "city": "Bucuresti",
    "zip_code": "030000",
    "country": "Romania"
  },
  "delivery_addresses": [
    {
      "street": "Sos. Chitilei nr. 50",
      "city": "Bucuresti",
      "zip_code": "010000",
      "country": "Romania"
    }
  ],
  "payment_terms": "NET_30",
  "category": "VIP",
  "credit_limit": 100000.0
}

### 2.2. Adaugă un Contract (Pentru Discount)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/contracts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "start_date": "2024-01-01",
  "end_date": "2025-12-31",
  "service_level": "EXPRESS",
  "discount_rate": 0.15
}

### ==========================================
### 3. MODULUL SHIPMENT (Fluxul Principal)
### ==========================================

### 3.1. Creează o Cursă (Status: PENDING)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reference_number": "CMD-2024-001",
  "customer_id": 1,
  "pickup_location": {
    "street": "Depozit Central",
    "city": "Bucuresti",
    "zip_code": "030000",
    "country": "Romania",
    "contact_person": "Magazioner Sef",
    "contact_phone": "0700111222"
  },
  "delivery_location": {
    "street": "Magazin Brasov",
    "city": "Brasov",
    "zip_code": "500000",
    "country": "Romania",
    "contact_person": "Director Magazin",
    "contact_phone": "0700333444"
  },
  "cargo_details": {
    "description": "Paleti Apa Minerala",
    "weight_kg": 22000,
    "volume_m3": 80,
    "special_handling_requirements": "Fragil",
    "additional_notes": "Livrare la rampa 2"
  },
  "pickup_date_time": "2025-06-01T08:00:00",
  "requested_delivery_date_time": "2025-06-01T18:00:00",
  "price": 2000.0
}

### 3.2. Alocă Resursele (Status -> SCHEDULED)
# NOTĂ: Dacă rulezi pe o bază curată, ID-urile vor fi 1.
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shipments/1/assign?driverId=1&vehicleId=1

### 3.3. Simulează Transportul (Status -> PICKED_UP)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shipments/1/status/PICKED_UP

### 3.4. Simulează Transportul (Status -> IN_TRANSIT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shipments/1/status/IN_TRANSIT

### 3.5. Confirmă Livrarea (Status -> DELIVERED & Generare Factură)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shipments/1/confirm-delivery
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actual_delivery_date_time": "2025-06-01T17:30:00",
  "recipient_name": "Director Magazin Brasov",
  "recipient_signature": "Semnatura Digitala",
  "issues_or_damages": "Niciuna",
  "photo_documentation_url": "http://cloud/delivery/img1.jpg"
}

### ==========================================
### 4. VERIFICARE FINANCIARĂ & MENTENANȚĂ
### ==========================================

### 4.1. Vezi Facturile Clientului (Ar trebui să fie una nouă)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/1/invoices

### 4.2. Plătește Factura (Status -> PAID)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/invoices/1/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_date": "2025-06-02",
  "amount": 2040.0,
  "payment_method": "BANK_TRANSFER",
  "reference_number": "OP-555999"
}

### 4.3. Înregistrează o Mentenanță la Vehicul
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fleet/vehicles/1/maintenance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-05-01",
  "maintenance_type": "ROUTINE_SERVICE",
  "description": "Schimb ulei si filtre",
  "cost": 500.0,
  "service_provider": "Service Camioane SRL"
}